From: Aditya Sethi <72063181+TechyAditya@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 03:37:56 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] WayDroidService: Add media player manager

Send the active media sessions to the host's waydroidmediaplayers
service, which shows them in the desktop's media controls with their
title, artist, album, cover and position, and run the play, pause,
stop, next, previous, seek and raise commands it sends back.

While the host shows a session, its media notification is no longer
forwarded to the host's notification list: like SystemUI, which shows a
media notification as a media control, the desktop shows it as a
player. A host without the service gets media notifications as before.

Closes: https://github.com/waydroid/waydroid/issues/868
Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
